# Tauri / Rust

- Add `#[tauri::command]` handlers in `src-tauri/src/commands/commands.rs`.
- Register new commands in the `invoke_handler` list in `src-tauri/src/lib.rs`.
- Shared state: `src-tauri/src/state/state.rs`. Models: `src-tauri/src/mdoels/`
  (preserve the `mdoels` spelling unless asked to rename).
- Permission changes: update `src-tauri/capabilities/default.json` and
  `desktop.json` when desktop-only grants apply.
- Prefer `?` / mapped errors over bare `unwrap()` in command paths.

```text
❌ BAD: new command file only — never registered, no capability entry
✅ GOOD: commands.rs + lib.rs invoke_handler + capabilities as needed
```
